		{
			description: [
				"Beneath the crust of this untamed world lies the &2Primordial Caves&r, a planet frozen in time where evolution peaked during the age of reptiles."
				""
				"&6Tremorsaurus&r and &cRelicheirus&r roam among colossal &bPewen Trees&r, while prehistoric ferns and cycads reclaim every inch of space. The air hums with life and the echoes of creatures that have never seen the sun."
				""
				"Beneath the amber light, forgotten tribes once painted their stories upon cave walls. Their marks remain, a silent reminder of an ancient civilization that once existed below the surface."
				""
				"Traverse the &2Primordial Caves&r and harvest it of the necessary resources to assist in the completion of the &cTier 6 Rocket.&r"
			]
