		{
			dependencies: ["02B64409ADCA0977"]
			description: [
				"In the darkest depths of the &3Abyssal Chasm&r dwell the &8Deep Ones&r."
				""
				"They are neutral to you in the beginning, but their favor can be earned through offerings at the &bAbyssal Altars&r scattered across the ruins. You can also lose favor with them by attacking them."
				""
				"Place a &dPearl&r or a &bHeart of the Sea&r upon one of these altars to draw their attention. They will approach, inspect your gift, and offer something in return. Each successful trade increases your reputation. Trade with them enough, and they may even fight beside you."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_pearl_trading_1.png width:200 height:130 align:center}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You’ll know your trade was successful when the altar lights up and an item materializes upon the &bAltar of Abyss.&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_pearl_trading_2.png width:180 height:130 align:center}"
			]
			icon: {
