		{
			dependencies: ["6FEAE83D8A5815F4"]
			description: [
				"The &8Hullbreaker&r is the apex predator of the &3Abyssal Chasm&r, a massive creature that patrols the darkest of trenches."
				""
				"It is neutral to begin with, seeing you as nothing more than a simple being. Prove it wrong and slay the beast."
				""
				"Defeating it rewards you with an &bEnigmatic Engine&r, a powerful component once used by the ancient explorers of this world."
				""
				"This engine can be used to build your own submarine, or later used in the &6Conversion Crucible&r found within the &dCandy Cavity.&r"
				""
				"It also rewards you with an &bImmortal Embryo.&r Hold onto it, as it will become useful once you reach the Primordial Caves."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/alex_caves_hullbreaker.png width:230 height:130 align:center}"
			]
