		{
			dependencies: ["1FE777D1CAD0CE01"]
			description: [
				"Amber clusters hang from the ceilings of the &2Primordial Caves&r, glowing softly with trapped light from ages long past. Break these clusters carefully to collect &6Amber&r. Occasionally, you may discover a rare &dAmber Curiosity&r when breaking Amber."
				""
				"Gather both materials to begin unlocking the secrets buried within this world."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"You can also find an Amberlite Vent to be able to produce endless Amber."
