		{
			dependencies: ["4BCFFCA2CE2DD14C"]
			description: [
				"Your next step is to venture to one of the &cVolcanoes&r that dot the &2Primordial Caves&r. Within their molten cores lies &6Primal Magma&r, a raw and powerful material that radiates the heat of a living world."
				""
				"Harvest the magma carefully, as its energy is unstable yet essential for advanced engineering."
				""
				"&6Primal Magma&r is a critical component in the construction of the &cTier 6 Rocket.&r"
