		{
			dependencies: ["381DC5AB20E3A10F"]
			description: [
				"The &2Primordial Caves&r are filled with ancient plant life that has nourished this world since the dawn of time. Many of these prehistoric crops can still be harvested and used to craft powerful restorative foods."
				""
				"&2Tree Stars&r can be obtained from the &aAncient Jungle Trees&r that rise above the amber glow, while &ePine Nuts&r drop from the towering &bPewen Trees&r. &3Fiddleheads&r are found in &6Caveman Houses&r and can also be renewably farmed using &aBotany Pots&r."
				""
				"Combine these three ingredients to create the &2Serene Salad&r, a rare and revitalizing dish capable of soothing even the most ferocious creatures."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &2Serene Salad&r holds the key to taming the mighty &6Tremorsaurus&r. Strike the creature with a &aPrimal Club&r to weaken it, then feed it a &2Serene Salad&r while it is stunned. Repeat this process &73 to 8 times&r until the beast accepts you as its master."
				""
				"Once two &6Tremorsauruses&r are tamed, feed them &cRaw&r or &eCooked Dinosaur Chops&r. They will dig into the ground and produce a &dTremorzilla Egg&r. Mine the egg carefully with &bSilk Touch&r to keep it intact."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "alexscaves:tremorsaurus_egg"
