		{
			description: [
				"Formed in ancient currents and nestled among deep-sea ruins and tube worm colonies, these vents radiate a soft luminescence. The &bPearlyte Vent&r holds the key to underwater industry-but only for those bold enough to descend into the pressure-filled unknown."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/pearlyte_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To breathe life into this dormant marine relic, place &la blaze cake&r atop its core and feed it a blaze cake. The transformation will crack open the shell of inactivity, revealing a living vent ready for fluid infusion."
				""
				"Once activated, the vent will await its &dsource fluid&r (explained in the next quest). When supplied, it will enable &lMechanical Extruder&r automation of pearls, allowing you to harvest this deep-sea treasure on demand."
				""
				" &7Beneath the waves lies brilliance. Ignite the deep. Harness the pearls of the abyss.&r"
			]
			icon: "create_resource_vents:dormant_pearlyte_vent"
			id: "6AE156D8DE1D619A"
			rewards: [{
				id: "1F4B2E46FAFCF587"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			subtitle: "Ignite the Stone, Unleash the Flow. Click me for more info!"
